    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Horror Adventures pg. 86",
    "definition_raw": "Source Horror Adventures pg. 86\nThe repulsive horror of your smothering attack nearly incapacitates most foes.\n\nPrerequisites: Engulf Revulsion; engulf or smother universal monster ability.\n\nBenefit: When you successfully engulf or smother an opponent, successfully maintain a grapple combat maneuver on a smothered opponent, the opponent must succeed at a Will save (DC = 10 + 1/2 your Hit Dice + your Strength modifier) or become staggered for 1 round. This is a mindaffecting fear effect.",
